Two spells do subtly change behavior going from Skilled to Expert: 
protection (lasts twice as long) and jumping (improves range). Only 
Priests can reach expert in protection (clerical school) and only 
Wizards can reach expert in jumping (escape school). Still, aside from 
those two spells (if you use them), you should only advance a school to 
expert if you either can't get skill in a lot of schools (e.g. Healers) 
or have a high-level spell that can really use the lower failure rate 
(finger of death, cancellation, polymorph...).


